    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Teeko, an award-winning mobile health application developed by the Aga Khan Development Network's Digital Health Resource Centre, is set to be scaled up yet again in a move that will see the Android-based application be deployed in Afghanistan and northern Pakistan.",
